]
  Line 4: 君既为府吏，守节情不移，贱妾留空房，相见常日稀。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 5: 鸡鸣入机织，夜夜不得息。
