]
  Line 6: 三日断五匹，大人故嫌迟。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 7: 非为织作迟，君家妇难为！
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 8: 妾不堪驱使，徒留无所施，便可白公姥，及时相遣归。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 9: 府吏得闻之，堂上启阿母：儿已薄禄相，幸复得此妇，结发同枕席，黄泉共为友。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 10: 共事二三年，始尔未为久。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 11: 女行无偏斜，何意致不厚？
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 12: 阿母得闻之，槌床便大怒：小子无所畏，何敢助妇语！
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 13: 吾已失恩义，会不相从许！
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 14: 府吏默无声，再拜还入户。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 15: 举言谓新妇，哽咽不能语：我自不驱卿，逼迫有阿母。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 16: 卿但暂还家，吾今且报府。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 17: 不久当归还，还必相迎取。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 18: 以此下心意，慎勿违吾语。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 19: 新妇谓府吏：勿复重纷纭。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 20: 往昔初阳岁，谢家来贵门。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 2: 天似穹庐，笼盖四野。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 2: 不闻机杼声，唯闻女叹息。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 3: 问女何所思，问女何所忆。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 4: 女亦无所思，女亦无所忆。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 5: 昨夜见军帖，可汗大点兵，军书十二卷，卷卷有爷名。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 6: 阿爷无大儿，木兰无长兄，愿为市鞍马，从此替爷征。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 7: 东市买骏马，西市买鞍鞯，南市买辔头，北市买长鞭。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 8: 旦辞爷娘去，暮宿黄河边，不闻爷娘唤女声，但闻黄河流水鸣溅溅。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 9: 旦辞黄河去，暮至黑山头，不闻爷娘唤女声，但闻燕山胡骑鸣啾啾。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 10: 万里赴戎机，关山度若飞。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 11: 朔气传金柝，寒光照铁衣。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 12: 将军百战死，壮士十年归。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 13: 归来见天子，天子坐明堂。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 14: 策勋十二转，赏赐百千强。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 15: 可汗问所欲，木兰不用尚书郎，愿驰千里足，送儿还故乡。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 17: 开我东阁门，坐我西阁床。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 18: 脱我战时袍，著我旧时裳。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 19: 当窗理云鬓，对镜帖花黄。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 20: 出门看火伴，火伴皆惊忙：同行十二年，不知木兰是女郎。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 2: 桃花仙人种桃树，又摘桃花换酒钱。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 3: 酒醒只来花前坐，酒醉还来花下眠。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 4: 半醒半醉日复日，花落花开年复年。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 5: 但愿老死花酒间，不愿鞠躬车马前。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 6: 车尘马足富者趣，酒盏花枝贫者缘。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 7: 若将富贵比贫贱，一在平地一在天。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 8: 别人笑我忒风颠，我笑他人看不穿。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 2: 看七月半之人，以五类看之。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 3: 其一，楼船箫鼓，峨冠盛筵，灯火优傒，声光相乱，名为看月而实不见月者，看之。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 2: 夜向久、明河东畔，电飞云绕。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 3: 错落疏星垂屋角，须臾万弩鸣林杪。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 4: 渐翠竹、苍梧嫩凉生，惊秋早。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 5: 人语静，签声杳。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 6: 珍簟冷，纱厨小。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 7: 想云窗依旧，梦寻难到。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 8: 雁足空来书断绝，眉头顿著愁多少。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 2: 貞芳日有分，生長耐相容。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 3: 結根各得地，幸沾雨露功。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 4: 參辰無停泊，且顧一西東。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 2: 水何澹澹，山岛竦峙。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 3: 树木丛生，百草丰茂。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 4: 秋风萧瑟，洪波涌起。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 5: 日月之行，若出其中；
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.

]
  Line 6: 星汉灿烂，若出其里。
  English translation: [Line translation pending, refer to authoritative translations by Xu Yuanchong, David Hawkes, Arthur Waley, Ezra Pound, Burton Watson for comparison.
